{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d4c8e2a0-9b1f-4e2d-8c7a-digi-payment-gateway",
    "name": "Digi Payment Gateway",
    "description": "Digi Payment Gateway — REST collection aligned with the Spring Boot app.\n\n**Integration** (`/api/v1/integration/**`): Send `X-API-Key` (merchant API key). `security.ApiKeyAuthenticationFilter` resolves the merchant for paths under `security.integration.path-prefix` (default `/api/v1/integration/`). Do **not** send `merchantId` in the payment-link body. DTOs: `integration.api.dto`.\n\n**Users** (`/api/v1/users/**`): `POST /api/v1/users` is public (signup). Other user routes require `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`. `user.controller.UserController`.\n\n**Merchants** (`/api/v1/merchants/**`): All routes require Bearer JWT. `merchant.controller.MerchantController`.\n\n**Auth** (`/api/v1/auth/**`): Login, OTP, forgot password, refresh, logout — public per `SecurityConfig`; no Bearer.\n\n**Webhooks** (`/webhook/**`): No API key or JWT (`permitAll`). Production should add signature verification.\n\nDefault `baseUrl`: `http://localhost:8080`. Set `{{apiKey}}` from `MerchantResponse.apiKey` after creating a merchant.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "apiKey", "value": "your-merchant-api-key" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "paymentId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "merchantId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "configId", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Integration API",
      "description": "Third-party server-to-server API. `ApiKeyAuthenticationFilter` authenticates requests whose URI starts with the integration prefix. JWT is not used on these paths.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Payment link",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Generate payment link",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "X-API-Key", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"merchantReferencePaymentId\": \"ORDER-12345\",\n  \"amount\": 99.99,\n  \"merchantMetadataJson\": \"{\\\"orderId\\\":\\\"ORD-001\\\"}\",\n  \"redirectSuccessUrl\": \"https://merchant.example/pay/success\",\n  \"redirectFailureUrl\": \"https://merchant.example/pay/failure\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integration/payment-link/generate",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "integration", "payment-link", "generate"]
                },
                "description": "`integration.api.controller.PaymentLinkIntegrationController`. Body: `integration.api.dto.PaymentLinkRequest` (merchantReferencePaymentId, amount ≥ 0.01, optional merchantMetadataJson, redirectSuccessUrl, redirectFailureUrl). Merchant from `X-API-Key` only. 201 + `integration.api.dto.PaymentLinkResponse`. TEST adapter URLs look like `http://localhost:8080/test-payment-link.html?paymentId=...&merchantId=...`."
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Transactions",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "List transactions",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "X-API-Key", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integration/transactions",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "integration", "transactions"]
                },
                "description": "`integration.api.controller.TransactionIntegrationController`. Returns `List<integration.api.dto.PaymentDetailsResponse>` for the merchant from the API key."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Get payment details by id",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "X-API-Key", "value": "{{apiKey}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integration/transactions/{{paymentId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "integration", "transactions", "{{paymentId}}"]
                },
                "description": "`integration.api.dto.PaymentDetailsResponse` for `id`, scoped to the merchant from the API key."
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Payment channel webhooks",
      "description": "Inbound provider callbacks. Not under `/api/v1`. Handler: `paymentchannelwebhook.controller.WebhookPaymentChannelController`. `channelKey` is matched case-insensitively to `PaymentChannelNameEnum` (e.g. `test`, `TEST`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "TEST webhook (success)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"paymentStatus\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"paymentId\": {{paymentId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhook/v1/payment-channel-webhooks/test",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhook", "v1", "payment-channel-webhooks", "test"]
            },
            "description": "`TestPaymentChannelAdapter.validateAndParseWebhook`. Body: `paymentStatus` (`PaymentStatusEnum`), numeric `paymentId`. Response: `paymentchannel.dto.WebhookAdapterResponse`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "TEST webhook (failed)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"paymentStatus\": \"FAILED\",\n  \"paymentId\": {{paymentId}}\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhook/v1/payment-channel-webhooks/test",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["webhook", "v1", "payment-channel-webhooks", "test"]
            },
            "description": "Same handler with FAILED status sample."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth, users & merchants",
      "description": "Authentication (`/api/v1/auth/**`), users (`/api/v1/users/**`), and merchants (`/api/v1/merchants/**`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Auth",
          "description": "`auth.controller.AuthController`. No Bearer on these routes. OTP is logged in dev; not sent by email or SMS.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Login (email)",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
                },
                "description": "`auth.dto.AuthLoginRequest` → `AuthLoginResponse`. Copy `accessToken` / `refreshToken` into collection variables."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Login email — request OTP",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login/email/request-otp",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login", "email", "request-otp"]
                },
                "description": "`auth.dto.AuthEmailOtpRequest`. Dev: OTP is logged server-side, not emailed."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Login email — verify OTP",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login/email/verify-otp",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login", "email", "verify-otp"]
                },
                "description": "`auth.dto.AuthEmailVerifyOtpRequest` (6-digit otp). Returns `AuthLoginResponse` with tokens."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Forgot password — request email OTP",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password/email/request-otp",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "forgot-password", "email", "request-otp"]
                },
                "description": "`auth.dto.AuthEmailOtpRequest`. Returns `AuthOtpRequestResponse`."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Forgot password — reset with OTP",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"newPassword123\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/forgot-password/email/reset-password",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "forgot-password", "email", "reset-password"]
                },
                "description": "`auth.dto.AuthForgotPasswordResetRequest` (email, 6-digit otp, newPassword 8–128 chars). 204 No Content."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Login mobile — request OTP",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"+14155552671\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login/mobile/request-otp",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login", "mobile", "request-otp"]
                },
                "description": "`auth.dto.AuthMobileOtpRequest` (E.164). Returns `AuthOtpRequestResponse`."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Login mobile — verify OTP",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"+14155552671\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login/mobile/verify-otp",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login", "mobile", "verify-otp"]
                },
                "description": "`auth.dto.AuthMobileVerifyOtpRequest`. Returns `AuthLoginResponse`."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Refresh token",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh-token",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh-token"]
                },
                "description": "`auth.dto.AuthRefreshRequest`. Returns new `AuthLoginResponse`."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Logout",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "logout"]
                },
                "description": "`auth.dto.AuthLogoutRequest`. 204 No Content; refresh token invalidated."
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Users",
          "description": "`user.controller.UserController` — `/api/v1/users`.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Create user",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"newuser@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"name\": \"New User\",\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"+14155552671\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "users"]
                },
                "description": "`user.dto.UserCreateRequest` (mobileNumber optional; E.164 if set). Public — no Bearer."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "List users",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "users"]
                },
                "description": "No `@GetMapping` on `/users` (list is commented out in `UserController`) — expect **404**, not 501."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Get user",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}"]
                },
                "description": "`AuthService.assertAuthenticatedUserOwnsUserId` — principal must match `userId`. Returns `user.dto.UserResponse`."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Patch user",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Updated Name\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}"]
                },
                "description": "`user.dto.UserUpdateRequest` (self-only). Returns `UserResponse`."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Reactivate user",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/reactivate",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}", "reactivate"]
                },
                "description": "`POST .../users/{userId}/reactivate` — self-only; `UserService.reactivateUser` → `UserResponse`."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Delete user",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "{{userId}}"]
                },
                "description": "Soft-deactivates user via `UserService`. 204 No Content."
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Merchants",
          "description": "`merchant.controller.MerchantController` — `/api/v1/merchants`.",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Create merchant",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Acme Corp\",\n  \"email\": \"merchant@example.com\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "merchants"]
                },
                "description": "`merchant.dto.MerchantCreateRequest` (name, email). Returns `MerchantResponse` including **apiKey** for integration — save to `{{apiKey}}`. Currency and webhook live on merchant **config** (`MerchantConfigCreateRequest`). Requires Bearer."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "List merchants",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "merchants"]
                },
                "description": "Returns `List<MerchantResponse>` for the authenticated user (`MerchantService.listMerchantsForUser`)."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Get merchant",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants/{{merchantId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "merchants", "{{merchantId}}"]
                },
                "description": "Owner check via `AuthService.assertAuthenticatedUserOwnsMerchant`. Returns `MerchantResponse`."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Patch merchant",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Acme Holdings\",\n  \"email\": \"billing@example.com\",\n  \"isActive\": true\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants/{{merchantId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "merchants", "{{merchantId}}"]
                },
                "description": "`merchant.dto.MerchantUpdateRequest` (optional name, email, isActive). Returns `MerchantResponse`."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Delete merchant",
              "request": {
                "method": "DELETE",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants/{{merchantId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "merchants", "{{merchantId}}"]
                },
                "description": "Deactivates merchant via `MerchantService`. 204 No Content."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Merchant config",
              "description": "Per-merchant operational config (currency, webhook URL). Paths: `.../merchants/{merchantId}/config`.",
              "item": [
                {
                  "name": "Get merchant config",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "GET",
                    "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants/{{merchantId}}/config",
                      "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "merchants", "{{merchantId}}", "config"]
                    },
                    "description": "Returns `merchant.dto.MerchantConfigResponse`."
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "Create merchant config",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "header": [
                      { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                      { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"webhookUrl\": \"https://merchant.example/hooks\"\n}"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants/{{merchantId}}/config",
                      "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "merchants", "{{merchantId}}", "config"]
                    },
                    "description": "`merchant.dto.MerchantConfigCreateRequest`: required 3-letter ISO 4217 `currency`; optional `webhookUrl`. 200 + `MerchantConfigResponse`."
                  },
                  "response": []
                },
                {
                  "name": "Patch merchant config",
                  "request": {
                    "method": "PATCH",
                    "header": [
                      { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                      { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
                    ],
                    "body": {
                      "mode": "raw",
                      "raw": "{\n  \"currency\": \"EUR\",\n  \"webhookUrl\": \"https://merchant.example/hooks/v2\"\n}"
                    },
                    "url": {
                      "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants/{{merchantId}}/config",
                      "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                      "path": ["api", "v1", "merchants", "{{merchantId}}", "config"]
                    },
                    "description": "`merchant.dto.MerchantConfigUpdateRequest` (optional currency, webhookUrl). Returns `MerchantConfigResponse`."
                  },
                  "response": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "Create payment channel config",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"paymentChannelId\": 1,\n  \"paymentChannelName\": \"TEST\",\n  \"configJson\": \"{}\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants/{{merchantId}}/payment-channel-configs",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "merchants", "{{merchantId}}", "payment-channel-configs"]
                },
                "description": "`merchant.dto.MerchantPaymentChannelConfigCreateRequest`: required `paymentChannelId`; optional `paymentChannelName` (`PaymentChannelNameEnum`: XPLORPAY, PAYMOB, STRIPE, RAZORPAY, TEST); optional `configJson`. 201 + `MerchantPaymentChannelConfigResponse`."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "List payment channel configs",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants/{{merchantId}}/payment-channel-configs",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "merchants", "{{merchantId}}", "payment-channel-configs"]
                },
                "description": "Returns `List<MerchantPaymentChannelConfigResponse>`."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Get payment channel config",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/merchants/{{merchantId}}/payment-channel-configs/{{configId}}",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": [
                    "api",
                    "v1",
                    "merchants",
                    "{{merchantId}}",
                    "payment-channel-configs",
                    "{{configId}}"
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Returns `MerchantPaymentChannelConfigResponse`."
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Patch payment channel config",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
